       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "PL - Card Grid",
         "name": "module_3",
         "params": {
          "accent_color": {
           "color": "#6BA644",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_style": "card",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p>Liquids skip the dissolution step entirely. Actives are immediately available for absorption, making liquids the right choice when speed matters or when the audience cannot tolerate pills.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-d03e635789.svg"
            },
            "title": "Highest bioavailability and fastest onset"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Customers can adjust serving size up or down with dropper or measured-cup dosing. Strong fit for pediatric formulations, sensitive populations, and ingredients with narrow therapeutic ranges.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-681f7474d8.svg"
            },
            "title": "Precise dose customization"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Liposomal and nano-emulsion liquid formats deliver fat-soluble vitamins and certain compounds with bioavailability that no other format can match. Premium positioning, premium price point.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-e2f38469a7.svg"
            },
            "title": "Best for liposomal and specialty delivery"
           }
          ],
          "eyebrow_style": "text",
          "gap": 28,
          "icon_badge": true,
          "icon_badge_color": {
           "color": "#c9dbe2",
