         "label": "PL - Content Split",
         "name": "module_6",
         "params": {
          "buttons": [],
          "content": "<p>Liquid manufacturing happens in sanitized stainless-steel mixing tanks under controlled temperature and pH conditions. Every batch goes through in-process pH, brix, and microbial testing, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, contaminants, and preservative efficacy. Filling, capping, and sealing happen on-site under sanitary conditions to maintain product integrity.</p>",
