         "params": {
          "align": "center",
          "body_size": 17,
          "content": "<p>With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p><p>FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p><p>When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:50px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:40px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" width=\"177\" height=\"80\" style=\"height:80px;width:auto;max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" width=\"55\" height=\"80\" style=\"height:80px;width:auto;max-width:100%;\"></p>",
